    Bug 1978879 - Create CardDAV directories synchronously again. r=mkmelin

    The `create` function should not await anything as it's not required for the password to be saved,
    or for initial sync to begin, before returning the directory. Some event listeners must be
    synchronous to avoid being cleaned up prematurely.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D295212

diff --git a/mail/components/accountcreation/content/accountSetup.js b/mail/components/accountcreation/content/accountSetup.js
